l,"published_at":"2026-07-23T15:59:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027134","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776360-1839041357027132","game_id":"steam-4776360","kind":"announcement","title":"Story endings · Enemy attack footprints · Smoother aiming","summary":"Hello, developers This update wires multi-ending story routes, readable enemy attack footprints, and smoother card-aiming performance. We're still iterating — feedback in Discussions or in-game “Feedback” is welcome. Story Multiple endings: clear / abandon resolves into different closing beats Final empty-film skill: the last blank frame now ties gameplay to the film-memory loop Combat Enemy attack footprints: see reach during intent / aim instead of guessing Clearer cast feedback for cards, ene","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T15:58:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027132","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776360-1839041357027130","game_id":"steam-4776360","kind":"announcement","title":"Character presence · Gallery & HUD fixes","summary":"Hello, developers This patch ties your chosen camera character more clearly into the menus, and cleans up gallery + bottom-left HUD display issues. We're still iterating — feedback in Discussions or in-game “Feedback” is welcome. Character presence Menu / map cats: coat follows last-played or current-run character Film canister: brand + model per character; band colors from the palette Shutter cursor picks up character colors Gallery Relics / cards / enemies show design-table entries only (no le","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T15:58:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357027130","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4776360-1837955055361457","game_id":"steam-4776360","kind":"update","title":"Fission Mirror Grid Update V0.1.3.0","summary":"2026-07-12 · Tactical tiles come alive; camp relic swap is no longer a black boxHello, Developer.This week's focus was making tactical mirror tiles on the 14×6 battlefield truly part of every turn's decisions, not just decorative tiles at spawn that you ignore for the rest of the fight.What we shipped this weekCombatTactical tile density increased: 6 / 8 / 10 tiles (early / mid / late); the map no longer feels too emptyFrom turn 2 onward, tiles reposition each turn while keeping type, cooldown, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T15:50:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055361457","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4776360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4776360":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4776360":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4783040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:04:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4776360","app_id":4776360,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:57Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","er